Package: mc-mrpack
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: any
Maintainer: Dylan Bulmer <dylan@bulmer.dev>
Depends: mc-server, ${shlibs:Depends}
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://apt.bulmer.dev
Description: Modrinth modpack support for mc-server
 Lets 'mc install' and 'mc upgrade' take a Modrinth .mrpack file, which pins the
 Minecraft version, the mod loader and every mod in one artifact.
 .
 A pack is attacker-controlled input handled as root, so every value in its
 manifest is validated before use: file paths may not escape the server
 directory, downloads must come from Modrinth's own CDN over https, and every
 file must publish a sha512 that is verified after download. mc re-applies the
 keys it owns in server.properties after a pack's own settings are merged, so a
 pack cannot enable RCON with a password of its choosing.
